<title>PHILIPPINES: Bogo-Medellin 9-mth net loss 22 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Bogo-Medellin 9-mth net loss 22 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bogo-Medellin Milling Co said on Tuesday it made an unaudited net loss of 22.48 million pesos in the first nine months of its current fiscal year ending September 30.</p>
<p>The company did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>The sugar miller made a net income of 5.911 million pesos for fiscal year 1995/1996.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
